		font-size: 16px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #FFFFFF;
		line-height: 22px;
	}

	.nav-placeholder {
		width: 32px;
		height: 32px;
		flex: 0 0 32px;
	}

	.content-scroll {
		min-height: 0;
		flex: 1;
	}

	.content {
		display: flex;
